<title>FINLAND: STROMSDAL 1996 EPS RISES TO 4.3 MARKKA.</title>
<headline>STROMSDAL 1996 EPS RISES TO 4.3 MARKKA.</headline>
<dateline>JUANKOSKI, Finland 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to</p>
<p>December 31-</p>
<p>					  (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		    4.3 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     7.0 vs 0.3</p>
<p> Net sales					    233 vs 220</p>
<p> Operating profit				    22 vs 14</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish paperboard maker is Stromsdal</p>
<p>Oy. The company's managing director Bjorn Forss gave the 1996</p>
<p>EPS figure in an interview with Reuters at company headquarters</p>
<p>in Juankoski, central Finland.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
